{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114221","id":3119026039,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc656I93","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114221","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114221.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114221.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114221","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114221/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114221/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114221/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ddaa9831412cc5aebe97f2a8b2426bac7147dd02","number":114221,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Use float for TextEdit horizontal margins","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108520\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110577 (same)\r\n- Reverts https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105870\r\n- Alternate fix for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105827\r\n- Alternate to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110791\r\n\r\nThis makes TextEdit (and CodeEdit) use floats for left and right content margins.\r\nThis doesn't affect the top and bottom ones since there isn't an issue with them currently and other controls that draw text seem to snap text to integers vertically anyway.\r\nChanges `get_line_column_at_pos` to accept Vector2 instead of Vector2i since it is used with the mouse position which is a Vector2.\r\nThe `h_scroll` functions now uses double to pass to the scrollbar, like the `v_scroll` ones.\r\nAlso changed some of the minimap horizontal mouse checks to be consistent so the hover and click detection matches the cursor.\r\n\r\nNote that TextEdit still has lots of issues in rtl layout mode, but the specific case in #105827 where the stylebox left and right margins were equal and ended with .5 or greater is fine.\r\nThis is easier to test with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114217","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description"